{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120631","id":3934960847,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7qirzP","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120631","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120631.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120631.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120631","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120631/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120631/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120631/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d5f5ac61bc34711c705e4b3bcca17d47d2c78b23","number":120631,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add new default algorithm of automatic focus strategy for `Control` nodes","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103895\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14659\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nThis PR, at it's core, introduces a new algorithm for inferring focus Controls without neighbors, dubbed the \"balloon algorithm\", which was discussed and iterated under https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103895. To go into a bit more detail, this PR:\r\n\r\n- Isolates the current auto focus strategy into a single function, dubbed the legacy algorithm (`_focus_strategy_legacy`)\r\n- Implements the new algorithm (`_focus_strategy_balloon`)\r\n- Introduces a ProjectSetting (`gui/common/auto_focus_strategy`) and this new algorithm as the default solution for newer projects.\r\n\r\n> [!TIP]\r\n> You can test this PR in this web demo: https://rsubtil.itch.io/godot-focus-tests-demo\r\n> This demo will be updated for any relevant changes with this MR. It allows to compare the old and new behavior as implemented in C++, as well as GDScript versions of this algorithm which allows for debug visualization to better understand it's functionality.\r\n\r\ncc @AdriaandeJongh @runevision @Rindbee","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/la